{
  "_comment": [
    "SMC rig -> Visual Components shadow. THE single rig description.",
    "Read by statesync.py ONLY. vc_gateway.py reads nothing - every fact it needs",
    "travels in the command envelope, so the pasted VC script never changes when the rig does.",
    "",
    "DERIVATION (2026-07-26):",
    "  station/component/twinName/vcId/states/disStates .. from Control.xml (the VueOne twin)",
    "  execution ............................................ structural: a binary PushJoint servo",
    "                                                         -> signal; multi-position controller",
    "                                                         -> axis; executor+routines -> routine",
    "  open/closed ......................................... VC joint limits PushJoint_Open/_Closed",
    "  positions ........................................... HAND-VERIFIED against the VC joint",
    "                                                         limits. DO NOT regenerate from the twin:",
    "                                                         Bearing_PnP re-uses State_Number 0 five",
    "                                                         times, so a naive extract swaps home/work",
    "                                                         and drops states 5/6.",
    "  durationsMs ......................................... MEASURED medians, MQTT/rig_cadence.log",
    "                                                         (n=27..108). The swivel is PHASE-KEYED:",
    "                                                         assembly and disassembly strokes do not",
    "                                                         overlap and are inverted.",
    "  states .............................................. THE TWIN'S state names, not the EAE CAT",
    "                                                         runtime vocabulary. VueOne resolves an",
    "                                                         incoming observation by stateName against",
    "                                                         the loaded model, so a name the twin does",
    "                                                         not carry is silently unresolvable and the",
    "                                                         component stops following. Guarded by",
    "                                                         tests/test_vueone_models.py.",
    "  routines ............................................ derivable from the twin, but pinned here",
    "                                                         because two disagree with the twin's",
    "                                                         state names (see _override notes).",
    "  verify .............................................. VC scene-graph node names; not in the twin.",
    "  presentState ........................................ PHYSICAL rig wiring, not the twin. Bearing",
    "                                                         and shaft part-present DIs are ACTIVE-LOW."
  ],

  "site": {
    "broker": { "host": "127.0.0.1", "port": 1883 },
    "unsPrefix": "uns/wmg/smc_rig/v1",
    "unsQos": 1,
    "vueone": { "enabled": true, "host": "127.0.0.1", "port": 51000, "clientId": "VC", "sendMinIntervalMs": 20 }
  },

  "protocol": {
    "schemaVersion": 2,
    "motionStartToDest": { "1": 2, "3": 4, "5": 6 },
    "commandTopic": "uns/wmg/smc_rig/v1/vc/command",
    "eventTopic": "uns/wmg/smc_rig/v1/vc/event",
    "routineTimeoutMs": 15000,
    "resyncOnReady": true
  },

  "components": {
    "smc/feeder": {
      "station": "feed_station", "component": "feeder", "twinName": "Feeder",
      "vcId": "Pusher", "execution": "signal", "lane": "pusher",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedFinished", "1": "Advancing", "2": "Advanced", "3": "Returning", "4": "ReturnedFinished" },
      "signal": { "behaviour": "PushJoint_ActionSignal", "open": 0.0, "closed": 116.0 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 716, "3": 1125 }
    },
    "smc/checker": {
      "station": "feed_station", "component": "checker", "twinName": "Checker",
      "vcId": "CheckerComp", "execution": "signal", "lane": "checker",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "Lowering", "2": "Down", "3": "Rising", "4": "RisingFinished" },
      "signal": { "behaviour": "PushJoint_ActionSignal", "open": 0.0, "closed": 30.0 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 563, "3": 325 }
    },
    "smc/transfer": {
      "station": "feed_station", "component": "transfer", "twinName": "Transfer",
      "vcId": "TransferComp", "execution": "signal", "lane": "transfer",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedFinished", "1": "Advancing", "2": "Advanced", "3": "Returning", "4": "ReturnedFinished" },
      "signal": { "behaviour": "PushJoint_ActionSignal", "open": 0.0, "closed": 209.0 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 1924, "3": 3436 }
    },
    "smc/clamp": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "clamp", "twinName": "Clamp",
      "vcId": "Clamp", "execution": "signal", "lane": "clamp",
      "states": { "0": "Home Pos", "1": "Clamp Part", "2": "Clamped", "3": "Unclamp Part", "4": "Home Finished" },
      "signal": { "behaviour": "PushJoint_ActionSignal", "open": 0.0, "closed": 32.4827386160209 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 166, "3": 280 }
    },
    "smc/ejector": {
      "station": "disassembly", "component": "ejector", "twinName": "Ejector",
      "vcId": "Ejector", "execution": "signal", "lane": "ejector",
      "states": { "0": "Home Pos", "1": "ToWork", "2": "AtWork", "3": "ToHome", "4": "AtHome" },
      "signal": { "behaviour": "PushJoint_ActionSignal", "open": 0.0, "closed": 90.0 },
      "_override_durations": [
        "NOT the measured rig gap. The Ejector is the ONLY actuator sensorless in BOTH",
        "directions (WorkSensorFitted=FALSE, HomeSensorFitted=FALSE, toWorkTime=toHomeTime",
        "=T#2000ms in the deployed sysres), so its measured 2011/2009/2005 ms is the PLC's",
        "COUNTDOWN, not a stroke - the rig cannot see this cylinder arrive. Animating 2000 ms",
        "swept 90 mm at 49.7 mm/s while every sensored cylinder on the rig runs 109-196 mm/s.",
        "600 ms = 90 mm at ~150 mm/s, the middle of that band. ESTIMATE, not a measurement;",
        "tune by eye. The endpoint verification holds the cylinder at the stop until the rig",
        "reports its next state, so the remaining PLC dwell costs nothing."
      ],
      "durationsMs": { "1": 600, "3": 600 }
    },

    "smc/bearing_pnp": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "bearing_pnp", "twinName": "Bearing_PnP",
      "vcId": "SviwelArmComp", "execution": "axis", "lane": "bearing",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "TurningPick", "2": "AtPick", "3": "TurningPlace", "4": "Place", "5": "TurningHome", "6": "AtHome" },
      "disStates": { "2": "AtPlace2", "4": "AtPick2" },
      "positions": { "0": 90.0, "2": 181.0, "4": 0.0, "6": 90.0 },
      "_override_durations": "PHASE-KEYED. Measured asm/dis populations do not overlap (2.3-2.9x apart, inverted). A flat table is wrong in both phases.",
      "durationsMs": { "asm": { "1": 441, "3": 1400, "5": 580 }, "dis": { "1": 1260, "3": 620, "5": 878 } }
    },
    "smc/shaft_hr": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "shaft_hr", "twinName": "Shaft_Hr",
      "vcId": "pnp_horizantal", "execution": "axis", "lane": "shaft",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "TurningWork", "2": "AtWork", "3": "TurningHome", "4": "ReturnedFinished" },
      "positions": { "0": 0.0, "2": 130.0, "4": 0.0 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 960, "3": 1070 }
    },
    "smc/shaft_vr": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "shaft_vr", "twinName": "Shaft_Vr",
      "vcId": "pnp_vertical", "execution": "axis", "lane": "shaft",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "Advancing", "2": "Advanced", "3": "Returning", "4": "ReturnedFinished" },
      "positions": { "0": -34.19, "2": 0.0, "4": -34.19 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 920, "3": 822 }
    },
    "smc/coverpnp_hr": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "coverpnp_hr", "twinName": "CoverPNP_Hr",
      "vcId": "CoverPnp_Horizantal", "execution": "axis", "lane": "cover",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "Advancing", "2": "Advanced", "3": "Returning", "4": "ReturnedFinished" },
      "positions": { "0": 0.0, "2": 100.0, "4": 0.0 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 1027, "3": 1188 }
    },
    "smc/coverpnp_vr": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "coverpnp_vr", "twinName": "CoverPNP_Vr",
      "vcId": "CoverPnp_Vertical", "execution": "axis", "lane": "cover",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "Lowering", "2": "Down", "3": "Rising", "4": "RisingFinished" },
      "positions": { "0": 0.0, "2": 25.0, "4": 0.0 },
      "durationsMs": { "1": 515, "3": 820 }
    },

    "smc/bearing_gripper": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "bearing_gripper", "twinName": "Bearing_Gripper",
      "vcId": "Swivel Arm", "execution": "routine", "lane": "bearing",
      "states": { "0": "Home", "1": "open", "2": "OpenGripper", "3": "close", "4": "CloseGripper" },
      "_override_routines": "INVERTED in this VC model, proven by runtime parent chain: OpenGripper TAKES the bearing, CloseGripper RELEASES it. Rig state 1 is the pick, so state 1 -> OpenGripper.",
      "routines": { "1": "OpenGripper", "3": "CloseGripper" },
      "verify": { "part": "Bearing", "carriers": ["Swivel Arm", "SviwelArmComp"], "attachedOn": [1] }
    },
    "smc/shaft_gripper": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "shaft_gripper", "twinName": "Shaft_Gripper",
      "vcId": "pnp", "execution": "routine", "lane": "shaft",
      "states": { "0": "ReturnedHome", "1": "Closing", "2": "CloseGripper", "3": "Opening", "4": "OpenGripper" },
      "routines": { "1": "CloseGripper", "3": "OpenGripper" },
      "verify": { "part": "Shaft", "carriers": ["pnp", "Shaft_Gripper"], "attachedOn": [1] }
    },
    "smc/coverpnp_gripper": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "coverpnp_gripper", "twinName": "CoverPnp_Gripper",
      "vcId": "coverpnp", "execution": "routine", "lane": "cover",
      "states": { "0": "AtReleasePos", "1": "GripPart", "2": "grasp", "3": "ReleasePart", "4": "release" },
      "routines": { "1": "grasp", "3": "release" },
      "verify": { "part": "TopCover", "carriers": ["coverpnp", "CoverPnp_Gripper"], "attachedOn": [1] }
    },
    "smc/robot": {
      "station": "disassembly", "component": "robot", "twinName": "Robot",
      "vcId": "UR3e", "execution": "routine", "lane": "robot",
      "states": { "0": "Home Pos", "1": "Partpick", "2": "Partplace" },
      "_override_routines": [
        "The twin names state 1 'PickPart'; the taught VC routine is 'Partpick'.",
        "ONE ATOMIC TASK. The rig's robot reports task-start (1), then task-done (2) and",
        "ready (0) only 2 ms apart at the END - measured 7827 ms apart from state 1. All of",
        "its motion happens inside state 1. Firing a separate routine on 2 and 0 replayed",
        "the place and the return AFTER the rig had already parked, which is what left the",
        "shadow seconds behind. The chain runs the whole task from state 1 instead; 2 and 0",
        "carry no motion and command nothing."
      ],
      "routines": { "1": ["Partpick", "Partplace", "Home"] }
    },

    "smc/PartInHopper": {
      "station": "feed_station", "component": "partinhopper", "twinName": "PartInHopper",
      "vcId": "Part Sensor", "execution": "sensor",
      "states": { "0": "Off", "1": "On" }, "presentState": 1
    },
    "smc/BearingSensor": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "bearingsensor", "twinName": "BearingSensor",
      "vcId": "BearingSensor", "execution": "sensor",
      "_override_presentState": "PHYSICAL: the bearing part-present DI is ACTIVE-LOW on the rig. Do not derive this from the twin.",
      "states": { "0": "Off", "1": "On" }, "presentState": 0
    },
    "smc/ShaftSensor": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "shaftsensor", "twinName": "ShaftSensor",
      "vcId": "ShaftSensor", "execution": "sensor",
      "_override_presentState": "PHYSICAL: ACTIVE-LOW, as BearingSensor.",
      "states": { "0": "Off", "1": "On" }, "presentState": 0
    },
    "smc/TopCoverSenosr": {
      "station": "assembly_station", "component": "topcoversenosr", "twinName": "TopCoverSenosr",
      "vcId": "TopCoverSensor", "execution": "sensor",
      "_override_topic": "The rig publishes BOTH smc/TopCoverSenosr (this, misspelled at source) and smc/TopCoverSensor. aliases catches the second so it is no longer discarded.",
      "aliases": ["smc/TopCoverSensor"],
      "states": { "0": "Off", "1": "On" }, "presentState": 1
    }
  }
}
